      "nets": ["unconnected-(FCC2-VDD-Pad11)", "unconnected-(NAVC2-VDD-Pad19)", "Net-(NAVC2-VSS-Pad18)", "+3V3", "+3.3V"],
      "observed": "The MCU main supply pins are not connected to a power net: FCC2 VDD pins 11/27/50/75/100 and NAVC2 VDD pins 19/32/48/64 are each on auto-generated unconnected nets. NAVC2 VSS pins 18 and 63 are tied together only, not to GND. The +3V3 net that carries MCU decoupling caps, pullups, VBAT and connector power is not connected to REG1 output +3.3V.",
      "expected": "The specification states that the LD39200PU33R 3V3 rail feeds both MCUs and sensors, so FCC2/NAVC2 VDD pins should be connected to the regulated 3V3 rail and VSS pins to GND.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (code \"216\") (name \"unconnected-(FCC2-VDD-Pad11)\") (node (ref \"FCC2\") (pin \"11\") (pinfunction \"VDD\") (pintype \"power_in\")))"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (code \"144\") (name \"Net-(NAVC2-VSS-Pad18)\") (node (ref \"NAVC2\") (pin \"18\") (pinfunction \"VSS\") (pintype \"power_in\")) (node (ref \"NAVC2\") (pin \"63\") (pinfunction \"VSS\") (pintype \"passive\")))"
        },
        {
          "source": "spec",
          "quote": "3.3 V LDO (MCUs + sensors)"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "Both MCUs are effectively unpowered/ungrounded; the board cannot boot or perform its intended flight-control/navigation function.",
      "confidence": 0.98
    },
    {
      "category": "other",
      "components": ["HSE1", "HSE3", "FCC2", "NAVC2", "R13", "R67"],
      "pins": ["HSE3.1", "HSE3.3", "FCC2.5", "FCC2.37", "FCC2.12", "FCC2.13", "HSE1.1", "HSE1.3", "NAVC2.5", "NAVC2.6"],
      "nets": ["NET0080", "NET0116", "Net-(C58-Pad1)", "Net-(FCC2-PH0)", "VREF+_FCC", "NET0034", "Net-(C46-Pad1)", "NET0072", "Net-(NAVC2-PH0)", "Net-(NAVC2-PH1)"],
      "observed": "The 25 MHz HSE crystals are not connected to the MCU HSE oscillator pins. FCC HSE3 pin 1 connects to FCC2 PE6 and pin 3 connects through R13 to FCC2 PE7, while FCC2 PH0 is only loaded by C1 and PH1 is on the VREF+_FCC net. NAVC HSE1 is connected only to C28/C46/R67 and not to NAVC2 PH0/PH1.",
      "expected": "For STM32H753VITx and STM32F405RGTx, the external high-speed crystal should be connected to the HSE oscillator pins PH0/PH1, as stated in the specification.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (code \"53\") (name \"NET0080\") (node (ref \"C49\") (pin \"1\") (pintype \"passive\")) (node (ref \"FCC2\") (pin \"5\") (pinfunction \"PE6\") (pintype \"bidirectional\")) (node (ref \"HSE3\") (pin \"1\") (pinfunction \"1\") (pintype \"passive\")))"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (code \"124\") (name \"Net-(FCC2-PH0)\") (node (ref \"C1\") (pin \"1\") (pintype \"passive\")) (node (ref \"FCC2\") (pin \"12\") (pinfunction \"PH0\") (pintype \"bidirectional\")))"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (code \"26\") (name \"NET0034\") (node (ref \"C28\") (pin \"1\") (pintype \"passive\")) (node (ref \"HSE1\") (pin \"1\") (pinfunction \"1\") (pintype \"passive\")))"
        },
        {
          "source": "spec",
          "quote": "HSE crystal (both MCUs)"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "The intended external 25 MHz HSE clock is unavailable to both MCUs; the board may fail to start or may fall back to an internal oscillator if software permits.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "category": "missing_component",
      "components": ["USB1", "USB3", "USB4"],
      "pins": ["USB1.2", "USB1.3", "USB3.2", "USB3.3", "USB4.2", "USB4.3"],
      "nets": ["unconnected-(USB1-D+-Pad3)", "unconnected-(USB1-D--Pad2)", "unconnected-(USB3-D+-Pad3)", "unconnected-(USB3-D--Pad2)", "NET0103", "NET0092", "NET0120"],
      "observed": "The netlist contains no otter_CH330 UART-to-USB converter components. Several USB data paths terminate in unconnected or single-node nets: USB1/USB3 D+/D- are unconnected, and USB4 D+/D-/ID pass through resistors into nets with only one node.",
      "expected": "The specification lists two CH330 UART-to-USB converters in the Connections sheet for programming/debug UART-to-USB paths.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source": "spec",
          "quote": "USB-UART bridges (programming/debug) | Connections | otter_CH330 ×2"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (code \"312\") (name \"unconnected-(USB1-D+-Pad3)\") (node (ref \"USB1\") (pin \"3\") (pinfunction \"D+\") (pintype \"bidirectional\")))"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (code \"68\") (name \"NET0103\") (node (ref \"R36\") (pin \"1\") (pintype \"passive\")))"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "The intended UART-to-USB programming/debug interfaces are absent or incomplete, changing the board's interface behavior relative to the specification.",
      "confidence": 0.85
    }
  ],
  "summary": "Anomaly detected: the netlist leaves the MCU power/ground and HSE oscillator connections open or miswired, and it omits the specified CH330 USB-UART bridges, so the board cannot behave as described in the Hades design specification."
}

